# sites played each id and the game's audio was transcribed: countdown 405 (clips 1-5 said "ONE!", "2", "THREE!", "FOUR!", "Five!"); ten_seconds 252 ("You better be fast, boy, cause time's ticking away!"); time_up 254 ("You have run out of time. / Time's up.")
